    "title": "Amazon will develop AR",
    "text": "Amazon will develop AR\nAmazon prepares an access to an enhanced actual market (AR) for many subjects. According to sources, the project has received an internal name Jay Jayhawk, and provides the release of a device with a microphone, speaker, camera and color screen in one eye.\nThe company plans to present a novelty at the end of 2026 or in early 2027. This will not be Amazon's first experience in creating such solutions. Previously, the company has started to develop specialized courier glass displaying routes and tips on a small screen when performing delivery.\nThe first lots of such a device for employees can appear in the second quarter of 2026, the output volume will be about 100 thousand copies.\nBoth models, according to information, use the same display technology. However, the version for consumers will vary in more compact and light design, as well as the ability to display fully.",
